     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">I’m not sure what you mean that you cannot check all columns (if it is a runtime issue, I would deal with that secondary after I have functioning code), but I would do the following:<div>- apply `paste0` to make each column a single string</div><div>- apply a regular expression to find A next to B</div><div>- use logical indexing to select the columns that have that being the case</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n<br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
