   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>If by &quot;A sits next to B&quot; you are referring to A and B vertically next to each other (that is, one on top of the other) in your sample matrix, this should work (implementing Doug&#39;s suggestions):</div><div>  </div><div>toy &lt;- matrix(c(&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;C&quot;), nrow = 3)</div><div>toy &lt;- data.frame(toy)</div><div>toy.list &lt;- lapply(toy, function(x) paste0(x, collapse = &quot;&quot;))</div><div>include &lt;- grepl(&quot;(AB|BA)&quot;, toy.list)</div><div>toy[include]</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
